# A fifteenth Russian story: a winter diary
subtitle: "New Year in Moscow, a rink on Red Square, minus twenty in Suzdal and a big yes in February: read Masha's winter diary in Russian, and hear her read it."
tags: ["russian","russian reading","russian story","suzdal","moscow"]
teaches: ["reading/reading-diaries","reading/reading-stories"]
thumb: "band \"A fifteenth Russian story: a winter diary\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Russian food idioms: первый блин комом","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/151-russian-food-idioms.cast"}

