A: Пя́тница, февра́ль. After work, I phone Ма́ша. Послу́шайте.
    draw o_tom o_tom_n o_masha o_masha_n o_phone o_day

    ask "Tom phones Masha. Has he made up his mind?" listen [{"voice":"a","who":"Том","text":"Ма́ша, я реши́л!"},{"voice":"b","who":"Ма́ша","text":"Что ты реши́л? Говори́!"},{"voice":"a","who":"Том","text":"Ве́чером скажу́! Ты бу́дешь до́ма?"},{"voice":"b","who":"Ма́ша","text":"Бу́ду. Жду!"}] options ["yes, he has decided","no, he is still thinking","he wants her advice"] correct 1
        right: Я реши́л! He has decided.
        wrong: Ма́ша, я реши́л! He has decided.
    voice b

    ask "When will Tom tell Masha what he decided?" listen same options ["this evening","tomorrow morning","next week"] correct 1
        right: Ве́чером скажу́!
        wrong: Ве́чером скажу́: this evening.
    voice b

    ask "Where will Masha be this evening?" listen same options ["at home","at the museum","at the restaurant"] correct 1
        right: Ты бу́дешь до́ма? — Бу́ду.
        wrong: Ты бу́дешь до́ма? — Бу́ду. At home.
    voice b

    erase o_tom o_tom_n o_masha o_masha_n o_phone o_day

A: Что я реши́л? The answer is in Masha's дневни́к: her diary of this winter.
    draw nw1 nw_note

A: And ра́да за него́: glad for him. You'll find it on the last page.
    draw nw2

    erase nw1 nw2 nw_note

A: Прочита́йте. Ма́ша reads it to you: no stress marks. Три́дцать пе́рвое декабря́.
