A: Вы́берите.
    draw q_clock

    quiz "Masha writes: «Пока́ би́ли ку́ранты, все загада́ли жела́ние.» When did they make a wish?" above q_clock shuffle false voice a
        right: Пра́вильно! Пока́: while.
        wrong: Пока́ би́ли ку́ранты: while the chimes were striking.
        * after the chimes had struck
        + while the chimes were striking
        * before the chimes struck

    erase q_clock

