A: Шесть вопро́сов. Пя́тница, у́тро: I phone О́льга with my answer. Послу́шайте.
    draw t_olga t_olga_n t_phone t_tom t_tom_n t_day

    ask "Tom phones Ольга, head chef of «Нева», about her offer. What does he tell her?" listen [{"voice":"a","who":"Том","text":"О́льга, э́то Том. Я согла́сен!","gloss":"Olga, it's Tom. I say yes!"},{"voice":"b","who":"О́льга","text":"Я так ра́да! С ма́рта ты — наш шеф.","gloss":"I'm so glad! From March you're our head chef."},{"voice":"a","who":"Том","text":"А когда́ ты уезжа́ешь в Москву́?","gloss":"And when do you leave for Moscow?"},{"voice":"b","who":"О́льга","text":"Ско́ро. Но мы бу́дем звони́ть друг дру́гу!","gloss":"Soon. But we'll phone each other!"}] options ["he says yes","he says no","he needs more time"] correct 1 test t1
        right: Я согла́сен!
        wrong: Я согла́сен: he says yes.
    voice a

    ask "Tom phones Ольга, head chef of «Нева», with his answer. From when is Tom head chef?" listen same options ["from March","from today","from next year"] correct 1 test t1
        right: С ма́рта ты — наш шеф.
        wrong: С ма́рта: from March.
    voice a

    erase t_olga t_olga_n t_phone t_tom t_tom_n t_day

